@startuml Garden Management
title Garden Management

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Backend" as API
participant "Database" as DB
participant "Agent Service" as Agent
participant "Scheduler" as Scheduler

== Creating New Garden ==
User -> App: Tap "Add Garden"
App -> User: Show garden form
User -> App: Enter garden name
App -> API: POST /api/gardens/\n{name}
API -> DB: Create garden record
DB -> API: Garden created
API -> Agent: Create AI agent for garden
Agent -> DB: Agent provisioned
API -> Scheduler: Register default schedule trigger
API -> App: Return garden details
App -> User: Display new garden in list

== Viewing Gardens ==
User -> App: Open app
App -> API: GET /api/gardens/
API -> DB: Fetch user's gardens
DB -> API: Return gardens list
API -> App: Garden data
App -> User: Display gardens

== Updating Garden ==
User -> App: Tap "Edit Garden"
App -> User: Show edit form
User -> App: Change name
App -> API: PUT /api/gardens/{garden_id}\n{name}
API -> DB: Update garden name
DB -> API: Updated
API -> App: Return updated garden
App -> User: Display updated name

== Deleting Garden ==
User -> App: Long-press garden
App -> User: Show delete confirmation
User -> App: Confirm deletion
App -> API: DELETE /api/gardens/{garden_id}
API -> DB: Remove garden and related data
DB -> API: Deleted
API -> App: Success status
App -> User: Remove garden from list

@enduml
